Subject: [PATCH] kexec-bzimage64: Fix sparse warnings
Message-ID: <20140917200050.GA12787@redhat.com>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=us-ascii
Content-Disposition: inline
User-Agent: Mutt/1.5.21 (2010-09-15)
